@startuml "Validation manuelle et gestion d'incidents"

title Gestion des cas spéciaux et validation manuelle

actor "Contrôleur\n(Staff événement)" as Controller
participant "App Mobile\n(Scan QR)" as MobileApp
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Ticket Controller" as TicketCtrl
participant "Ticket Service" as TicketSvc
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

== Gestion des incidents ==

alt Problème avec QR illisible
    Controller -> MobileApp: QR illisible
    MobileApp -> MobileApp: Activer mode manuel
    MobileApp --> Controller: "Saisie manuelle du code"
    Controller -> MobileApp: Saisir code billet manuellement
    MobileApp -> API: POST /api/tickets/validate-manual
    note right: Body: {ticketCode, eventId, reason: 'qr_unreadable'}
    API -> TicketCtrl: validateManualTicket(ticketCode, eventId)
    note over TicketCtrl: Suite identique à la validation normale
    TicketCtrl --> API: validation result
    API --> MobileApp: manual validation response
    MobileApp --> Controller: Résultat de la validation manuelle

else Participant sans billet numérique
    Controller -> MobileApp: Recherche par nom/email
    MobileApp -> API: GET /api/events/{eventId}/participants
    note right: Query: ?search=john.doe@email.com
    API -> TicketSvc: searchEventParticipants(eventId, query)
    TicketSvc -> DB: SELECT users, tickets WHERE event_id=? AND email LIKE ?
    DB --> TicketSvc: matching participants
    TicketSvc --> API: participants list
    API --> MobileApp: search results
    MobileApp --> Controller: Liste des participants trouvés
    
    Controller -> MobileApp: Sélectionner participant
    MobileApp -> API: POST /api/tickets/validate-by-participant
    note right: Body: {participantId, eventId}
    API -> TicketCtrl: validateParticipantTicket(participantId, eventId)
    TicketCtrl -> TicketSvc: findAndValidateParticipantTicket(participantId, eventId)
    TicketSvc -> DB: SELECT ticket WHERE userId=? AND eventId=? AND status='paid'
    DB --> TicketSvc: participant ticket
    note over TicketSvc: Validation du billet du participant
    TicketSvc --> TicketCtrl: validation result
    TicketCtrl --> API: participant validation response
    API --> MobileApp: validation success/error
    MobileApp --> Controller: Résultat de la validation par participant
end

@enduml